      "value": "Thank you for reporting the issue! It's related to a new `TrimStart`function in Unity 2022. UdonSharp got confused and compiled the wrong version of that function.\n\nAs a workaround, can you try using `TrimStart(null)` instead of just `TrimStart()`?",
